  "body": "Featuring four spacious bedrooms, two bathrooms, a double garage, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a large entertainer's deck, it's designed for modern family living. Positioned in a sought-after community, this sun-drenched home offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience and lifestyle. Set on a 280sqm freehold site, it is built on a solid block foundation, with fibre cement boards on the upper floor and a sophisticated plaster-rendered finish. \r\nWith no body corporate or residents' association fees, you'll enjoy greater freedom and lower ongoing costs. Whether you're a family seeking room to grow, a first-home buyer, an investor, or someone looking to supplement the mortgage with flatmates, this versatile property delivers outstanding lifestyle and value. \r\nCommuting is a breeze with the weekday ferry service providing convenient access to the city. On weekends, immerse yourself in the best of coastal living, with marina strolls, local cafés, beautiful beaches, stunning Hauraki Gulf views, and the natural beauty of Shakespear Regional Park all close by. The shopping, dining, and lifestyle hubs of Whangaparaoa Peninsula, Orewa, and Silverdale are just a short drive away. Zoned within walking distance of prestigious Wentworth School and College, and with the upcoming Penlink connection enhancing access to SH1, this is a location with an exciting future. \r\nThis property ticks all the boxes! Motivated owners are downsizing and are ready to sell. Don't miss this fantastic opportunity. Act now!",
